<title>UK: Commerzbank unit adds 75 mln stg to Dec 2001 bond.</title>
<headline>Commerzbank unit adds 75 mln stg to Dec 2001 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers SBC Warburg, Commerzbank and Hambros Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COMMERZBANK OVERSEAS FINANCE NV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  COMMERZBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    *75 MLN STG   COUPON     7.0	 MATURITY    31.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.572    PAY DATE  **16.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> NOTES	*ORIGINAL 100 MLN STG LAUNCHED 02.FEB.96</p>
<p>	     **PLUS 211 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS ***</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.275     SELL CONC  1.6	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	***US/UK/NL/DE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
